OL,3,GNEWSAOne of the five men arrested near
OL,4,ARAF Fairford called 999 himself
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were released on bail on Monday in
OL,7,Fwhat police described as an
OL,8,F"investigative decision" "grounded in
OL,9,Fexperience and strategy".
